#: prologue:prologue_9C5985A3_A450_4279_89AD_E4C9055CB369
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 04f70cc52a825477206ab285977bb893c14f51042784091fee30916638b2cb20
#. default-sha256: 174d1ee29b455c7b2de6835dfe909cae816a7ccf0f3bcae22aa3428c896da4ac
msgctxt "prologue:prologue_9C5985A3_A450_4279_89AD_E4C9055CB369"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫What’s the occasion? You never come to wake me up."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫あなたが私を起こすだなんて、⟪k:1⟫珍しいこともあるものですね。"

#: prologue:prologue_68962FD1_5789_4814_BF46_B3586D07440A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 074e6d16a6dc85cee1361cece160b3057852bc13c9b315e4f243b022abb244c8
#. default-sha256: 5c400683cc5dee395804cf227df4c56d085e1785a9f50b3c643def60a55e876f
msgctxt "prologue:prologue_68962FD1_5789_4814_BF46_B3586D07440A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I was merely concerned for your health.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫You really should be sleeping in a "
"proper bed."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫そんなところで眠っていらっしゃるから、⟪k:2⟫お風邪でも召したら良くないと思いまして。"

#: prologue:prologue_CF9E89B3_32AE_40C3_9AFC_47CEAC6DA8C3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ce005d49664f9b581a205b3e336dd96cf78f6676246e906bdd666103a497d02e
#. default-sha256: 91b61221dc2457fd8cc9d2a734e56c4c9c1ebe1780c01e877f6c800850644939
msgctxt "prologue:prologue_CF9E89B3_32AE_40C3_9AFC_47CEAC6DA8C3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫You were ⟪k:3⟫concerned⟪k:4⟫? About ⟪k:5⟫me⟪k:6⟫?⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫You do realize the "
"concept of “health” bears little meaning for either of us, don’t you?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫風邪など引きませんよ、⟪k:3⟫もはやそのような肉体ではないでしょう。⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫……という"
"か、⟪k:6⟫私の心配を？"

#: prologue:prologue_42F500E6_AADF_4523_B5D0_46846E73867B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d34c986ba2b621d1d9aee6dc1b4fc0e8c37cd4af0f281b8a3a29c42a850d2946
#. default-sha256: 84ee0fbd0736632f1bb56ae2222deb510354102c646794927af7d605681b790a
msgctxt "prologue:prologue_42F500E6_AADF_4523_B5D0_46846E73867B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Why would I not be concerned? ⟪k:2⟫You ⟪k:3⟫are⟪k:4⟫ me.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫If something were to "
"cause you to depart this world,⟪k:7⟫the same would happen to me."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫ええ、⟪k:2⟫だって、⟪k:3⟫あなたはわたくしなんでしょう？⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫あなたが消えてしまった"
"ら、⟪k:6⟫わたくしも消えてしまいますもの。"

#: prologue:prologue_B351EC4B_885F_482C_B4CB_BCEFFF7E34F7
