msgctxt "prologue:prologue_219F44A4_AECD_4C4F_AFBA_6559324490AB"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫(It was so long ago, I almost forgot I told her she was me.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫And it would seem she "
"still believes that to be the case.)"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫（そういえば大分前に、⟪k:1⟫そんな話をしたわ。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫　本当にすっかり信じ込んでしまって……）"

#: prologue:prologue_3BF7FF21_91E5_45AA_8A70_93A97AE211F1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6029b02d27c936cdd2b2fa59068956789aa88c55735ddec7465ebb9596b12479
