msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫In that case, perhaps you could tell me a story?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫……ねえ、⟪k:2⟫それならせっかくですし、⟪k:3⟫お話をしませんか？"

#: prologue:prologue_403866E0_6E4F_493B_A27C_2C7EAFE6329E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 39fb9c3b36a49d2d41c554e6d41050bcefe76ce71569cb075292729a3b66156d
