msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫A story?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫You mean the one about Michel and Giselle again?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫お話って。⟪k:3⟫また、⟪k:4⟫例のジゼルとミシェルの物語ですか？"

#: prologue:prologue_0B05D229_DD6F_426C_BBE6_F3909259CA5D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: faa5052fd08d4c4c6d7559d535d150f63a925fc870706c8de4dec1bc93ec1291
#. default-sha256: f5d4c65c904b5709f1c06414323c0fb4dbc6faaedfa62503041182c5b3e0d5c7
msgctxt "prologue:prologue_0B05D229_DD6F_426C_BBE6_F3909259CA5D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Yes, that one.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫I do love that story oh so very much."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫ええ、⟪k:2⟫そうです。⟪k:3⟫わたくし、⟪k:4⟫あのお話が一番好きなんですの。"

#: prologue:prologue_4604B25A_659B_44D1_9FFC_0469BC280F95
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b0b7f5b07b0b0ae0cda73a54d3c2a820f5d521e5ace29f55a5e3817cd9a97643
#. default-sha256: 1309c83fba26cc3689a12e66b991bd554be68babd58036dcf2de31c9c15001d1
msgctxt "prologue:prologue_4604B25A_659B_44D1_9FFC_0469BC280F95"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I, for one, am growing rather tired of it.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I’ve told it to you dozens of "
"times now."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫もう何度も話したではありませんか、⟪k:3⟫さすがに私が飽きましたよ。"

#: prologue:prologue_DB2E9551_BD10_4F5E_B19B_02E32600B333
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 133ab527162799279bb08c40241f2747fc50ba13c31d117919185c20a84b4fb1
#. default-sha256: 6ae95f38bfaa7a204e34413f142bc7cbd612ee6c7c2cf24d230660145367188f
msgctxt "prologue:prologue_DB2E9551_BD10_4F5E_B19B_02E32600B333"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Now, don’t be like that.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫The best stories never stop being moving,⟪k:4⟫no "
"matter how many times you hear them."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫良いじゃないですか、⟪k:2⟫素敵な物語は何度聞いても胸が弾みますわ。"

#: prologue:prologue_FE9551A9_E7B3_4525_AC83_90F29E5824B3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f3d97ad58548af015b23279d715a090ee6bd13ca2e6f7f20eae432e982832b26
