msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Hehe... ⟪k:3⟫Nothing difficult, I promise.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫I want to hear your opinion on "
"something."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫ふふ……、⟪k:3⟫簡単な質問ですよ。⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫あなたの考えを聞きたいのです。"

#: prologue:prologue_30C3C1BA_1D3D_4D6D_A3C5_556EB160ED24
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 261882a5b110203d63c25d8c916e370e1cb97948bfeb17c558b06a4e16368244
