msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫That is far from a simple question, if I do say so myself.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫She would certainly "
"be happiest if he were to return, yes."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫それは難しい質問ですわ。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫彼女のことを思えば、⟪k:4⟫もちろん巡り合った方が幸福の"
"はずです。"

#: prologue:prologue_574CD263_56B3_450E_9E3A_8C4E5B0D67D7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
